<item>
            <title>[JGVT-2698] Reports_Audit Trail: download audit trail report via web user interface</title>
                <link>https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-2698</link>
                <project id="46901" key="JGVT">TDS - Revvity Signals ELN</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;As a User,&lt;/b&gt; &lt;br/&gt;
I want to be able to access the experiment audit trail reports in a review friendly format to allow targeted GxP audit trail review.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Development notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Experiment name field, only 1 experiment name can be entered to download the experiment audit trail reports one by one&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Dowload link to be provided after search action&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Excel default normal view&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jnj.sharepoint.com/:p:/r/teams/NextGenELNforTDS/Shared%20Documents/General/1.%20Revvity/07.%20User%20Workshops/GxP%20Release%203.0.0/Audit%20Trail/Mock%20up%20Audit%20Trail%20report_Experiment.pptx?d=w13d749c3d18f40cf890c2bbab0291d89&amp;amp;csf=1&amp;amp;web=1&amp;amp;e=ZjsngH&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Mock up Audit Trail report_Experiment.pptx&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Testing notes&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Access to web user interface should be tested with an active signals user and with a user that does not have active signals account.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Testing can be done on both GxP-GMP experiment template&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
