                <customfields>
                                                <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;1) Access and download rights web user interface&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the user has an active signals account&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the signals user accesses the web user interface&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt; the web user interface shows an experiment name search field, search button and a placeholder for the pdf and excel download links&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;2) Download links available on web user interface&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt; the audit trail report is generated for the requested experiment&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; the signals user accesses the web user interface, enters the requested experiment name (Experiment number) and clicks the search button&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt; the download links are displayed in the web user interface for both the excel and pdf audit trail report&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3) Message when no report is available&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt; the web user interface shows an experiment name search field, search button and a placeholder for the pdf and excel download links&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; the signals user accesses the web user interface and enters an experiment name (Experiment number), clicks the search button and the audit trail report is still in progress or not yet requested&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt; a message is displayed to inform the user &quot;The audit trail report is not yet requested or is being generated.&quot;&#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;4) Downloaded PDF Experiment audit trail report&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt; the signals user accesses the web user interface and the download links (for pdf and excel) are displayed in the web user interface for both the excel and pdf audit trail report&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; the signals user clicks the download link for the pdf audit trail report&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the system shall download PDF report to the user download folder with the following details:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;A) Page layout and format: &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Landscape &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;A4&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;B) Header content on each page:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Experiment Name: eg. GMP000001&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Experiment description: &amp;lt;&amp;lt;as listed in signals&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Experiment closed date: &amp;lt;&amp;lt;as listed in signals&amp;gt;&amp;gt;or &quot;Experiment ongoing&quot; when not closed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;C) Table with the following columns (column header are defined between &quot;&quot;):&#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&quot;Date/Time&quot; (data and time+ TMZ (DD-MMM-YYYY hh:mm:ss (24h format) UTC+ x amount of offset time))&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&quot;User Name&quot; (eg. full name like Tamara Van den Broeck)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;User ID&quot; (eg. JnJ mail)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Entity Type&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Entity Name&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;&quot;Action&quot; (eg. create, edit, delete,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Change Type&quot; (eg. Worksheet Changes, Row Modified, Row Added, ...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Details&quot; (eg. when no new value is available, copy worksheet, delete table,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Old Value&quot; (eg. lists the previous value)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;New Value&quot; (eg. lists the current value)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Event ID&quot; (Signals event ID)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;D) The table will contain all actions in available in the Signals experiment history of the selected experiment.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;E) Footer content on each page:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Pagenumber with the following number: &amp;lt;&amp;lt;page&amp;gt;&amp;gt; of &amp;lt;&amp;lt;total pages&amp;gt;&amp;gt; eg. 1 of 15&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&quot;Created on: Date and time+ TMZ (DD-MMM-YYYY hh:mm:ss (24h format) UTC+ x amount of offset time)&quot; of PDF generation action&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;F) the downloaded pdf file will have Filename composed of the following components:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;Experiment Name eg. GMP000001&amp;gt;&amp;gt;_&amp;lt;&amp;lt;export timestamp DD-MMM-YYYY hh-mm-ss (24h format) UTC+ x offset&amp;gt;&amp;gt;.pdf&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5) Downloaded Excel Experiment audit trail report&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt; the signals user accesses the web user interface and the download links (for pdf and excel) are displayed in the web user interface for both the excel and pdf audit trail report&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; the signals user clicks the download link for the excel audit trail report&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt; the system shall download excel report to the user download folder with the following details:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A) Top rows content:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Row 1: Experiment Name: &amp;lt;&amp;lt;as listed in signals&amp;gt;&amp;gt; eg. GMP000001&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Row 2: Experiment description: &amp;lt;&amp;lt;as listed in signals&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Row 3: Experiment closed date: &amp;lt;&amp;lt;as listed in signals&amp;gt;&amp;gt;or &quot;Experiment ongoing&quot; when not closed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Row 4: &quot;Created on: Date and time+ TMZ (DD-MMM-YYYY hh:mm:ss (24h format) UTC+ x amount of offset time)&quot; of Excel generation action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;B) Table (excel table format) with the following columns (column header are defined between &quot;&quot;):&#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&quot;Date/Time&quot; (data and time+ TMZ (DD-MMM-YYYY hh:mm:ss (24h format) UTC+ x amount of offset time))&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&quot;User Name&quot; (eg. full name like Tamara Van den Broeck)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;User ID&quot; (eg. JnJ mail)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Entity Type&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Entity Name&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;&quot;Action&quot; (eg. create, edit, delete,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Change Type&quot; (eg. Worksheet Changes, Row Modified, Row Added, ...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Details&quot; (eg. when no new value is available, copy worksheet, delete table,...)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Old Value&quot; (eg. lists the previous value)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;New Value&quot; (eg. lists the current value)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Event ID&quot; (Signals event ID)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;C) The table will contain all actions in available in the Signals experiment history of the selected experiment.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;D)&lt;/font&gt;&#160;the downloaded excel file will have filename composed of the following components:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;Experiment Name eg. GMP000001&amp;gt;&amp;gt;_&amp;lt;&amp;lt;export timestamp DD-MMM-YYYY hh-mm-ss (24h format) UTC+ x offset&amp;gt;&amp;gt;.xlsx&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</customfieldvalue>

                        </customfieldvalues>
                    </customfield>
